      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Right margin",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>not to turn me away disappointed by your lack of favor.</li>\n<li>If you will be so kind, appoint someone to take up a</li>\n<li>collection for me so that I can buy</li>\n<li>a veil to cove[r]</li>\n<li>my head during the upcoming holiday,</li>\n<li>may God bless you</li>\n<li>and allow you to celebrate it for</li>\n<li>many years to come. Accept</li>\n<li>from me my pious prayers</li>\n<li>and earn abundant</li>\n<li>recompense. To you</li>\n<li>belongs the lofty decision.</li>\n<li><i>And peace</i></li>\n<li>and praise be to illustrious God.&nbsp;</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
